--- !u!114 &392811776
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 392811767}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bfd17b427b4c10e4089a3dbc80c13afa, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  timer: 120
  stringList:
  - "Be\u015Feri faaliyetler, sanayi at\u0131klar\u0131, yanl\u0131\u015F tar\u0131m
    uygulamalar\u0131, do\u011Fal kaynaklar\u0131n sorumsuzca kullan\u0131lmas\u0131
    \xE7evre kirliliklerine neden olmaktad\u0131r."
  - "\xC7evre kirlilikleri, hava kirlili\u011Fi, su kirlili\u011Fi, toprak kirlili\u011Fi,
    ses ve \u0131\u015F\u0131k kirlili\u011Fi olarak bilinmektedir."
  - "Salg\u0131n hastal\u0131klar\u0131n ya\u015Fanmas\u0131, bula\u015F\u0131c\u0131
    hastal\u0131klar\u0131n yay\u0131lmas\u0131, \xF6l\xFCmc\xFCl hastal\u0131klar\u0131n
    ortaya \xE7\u0131kmas\u0131, mevsimlerin de\u011Fi\u015Fmesi, ya\u011F\u0131\u015Flar\u0131n
    durmas\u0131, s\u0131cakl\u0131k farklar\u0131n\u0131n azalmas\u0131 ya da artmas\u0131,
    kurakl\u0131k, \xE7orakl\u0131k, yokluk, k\u0131tl\u0131k, susuzluk ya\u015Fanmas\u0131
    gibi olaylard\u0131r."
  - "Geri d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCm ve geri kazan\u0131m tesislerinin kurulmas\u0131
    gerekir. \xC7evre bilincinin olu\u015Fturulmas\u0131 gerekir. D\xFCzenli olarak
    \xE7evrenin temizlenmesi, korunmas\u0131, sanayi ve tar\u0131m faaliyetlerinin
    denetim ve g\xF6zetim alt\u0131nda tutulmas\u0131 gerekir."
  - "\xC7evre bilincinin sa\u011Flanmas\u0131 i\xE7in e\u011Fitim faaliyetleri yap\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r.
    Seminerler, paneller, forumlar olu\u015Fturulmal\u0131d\u0131r. Fuarlar kurulmas\u0131
    ve k\xFCresel sorunlara dikkat \xE7ekilmelidir. \xC7evre bilincinin olu\u015Fmas\u0131
    ve kanunlar\u0131n \xE7\u0131kar\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekir."
  - "\xDClkemizde sanayile\u015Fmenin fazla oldu\u011Fu yerlerde \xE7evre kirlili\u011Fi
    artm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r. Sanayile\u015Fmeden kaynaklanan \xE7evre kirlili\u011Fi
    en \xE7ok Marmara B\xF6lgesinde g\xF6r\xFCl\xFCr."
  - "\xC7evreye en az zarar veren ya\u011F\u0131\u015F t\xFCr\xFC ya\u011Fmurdur."
  baslikList:
  - "\xC7evre kirlili\u011Fine neden olan etkenler nelerdir?"
  - "\xC7evre kirlilikleri nelerdir?"
  - "\xC7evre kirlili\u011Finin neden oldu\u011Fu olaylar nelerdir?"
  - "\xC7evre kirliliklerini \xF6nlemek i\xE7in neler yapmal\u0131y\u0131z?"
  - "\xC7evre kirliliklerine kar\u015F\u0131 \xE7evre bilincinin sa\u011Flanmas\u0131
    nas\u0131l ger\xE7ekle\u015Febilir?"
  - "\xC7evre kirlili\u011Fi en \xE7ok hangi b\xF6lgemizde g\xF6r\xFCl\xFCr?"
  - "\xC7evreyi en az kirleten ya\u011F\u0131\u015F t\xFCr\xFC nedir?"
